# CODEOWNERS — docs/02-spec-fidelity.md §4.2 + docs/03-concurrency.md §1
#
# ⚠ ÖNEMLİ SINIRLAMA: CODEOWNERS yalnız REVIEW ister, YAZMAYI ENGELLEMEZ.
#    Tek başına kurmak yaygın bir hatadır (docs/03 §10 anti-pattern).
#    Yanına şunlar ZORUNLU:
#      - branch protection: "Require review from Code Owners" + admin'lere de uygula
#      - pre-commit hook: yalnız lokal hızlı geri bildirim
#      - CI gate: sahiplik ihlali → kırmızı
#      - feature ajanı token'ı: yalnız kendi branch'ine push
#
# Solda path, sağda sahip. Son eşleşen satır kazanır — sıra önemli.

# ---- varsayılan ----
*                               @tech-lead-agent

# ---- spec: PM yazar, İNSAN onaylar ----
/specs/acceptance-criteria/     @pm-agent @human-product-owner

# ---- testler: kod ajanına KAPALI (docs/02 §4.1) ----
/tests/acceptance/              @qa-agent
/tests/regression/              @qa-agent
/tests/hidden/                  @qa-agent

# ---- contract: Tech Lead; breaking change → insan (G3) ----
/contracts/                     @tech-lead-agent @human-product-owner

# ---- yüksek çekişmeli tek-sahipli yüzeyler (docs/03 §6) ----
/db/migrations/                 @migration-agent @human-product-owner
package-lock.json               @deps-agent
pubspec.lock                    @deps-agent
Podfile.lock                    @deps-agent
/generated/                     @ci-agent

# ---- ajan kendi kısıtlarını/gate'lerini yazamaz (docs/05 §5, docs/06 §5.1) ----
/.github/workflows/             @tech-lead-agent @human-product-owner
/CODEOWNERS                     @human-product-owner
/ownership-map.yml              @tech-lead-agent @human-product-owner
/AGENTS.md                      @tech-lead-agent @human-product-owner
/.claude/                       @tech-lead-agent @human-product-owner
/tools/                         @tech-lead-agent

# ---- risk sınıfı 🔴: insan okuması zorunlu (docs/05 §3.3) ----
/src/auth/                      @tech-lead-agent @security-agent @human-product-owner
/src/billing/                   @tech-lead-agent @human-product-owner

# ---- feature domainleri ----
/src/catalog/                   @backend-agent
/src/ui/                        @frontend-agent
/design/tokens/                 @designer-agent @human-designer

# ---- Unity: exclusive lease gerektirir (docs/03 §6) ----
/Assets/Scenes/                 @unity-integrator-agent
/Assets/Prefabs/Shared/         @unity-integrator-agent
